\section{Discussion}
\VAR{w.discussion}
\noindent This analysis followed adaptive exploration on discovery data. Rows reserved at ingest were
never passed to analysis code as inputs, and they are not evidence of verification. Subgroup analyses concern their declared
\BLOCK{if not adaptive}
restricted populations. Failed and missing specification attempts remain non-supporting; a single
exposure permutation is a diagnostic, not a calibrated permutation significance test.
\BLOCK{else}
operational selections; the substantive target is retained with explicit assumptions. Incomplete
coverage and unresolved fidelity are unavailable evidence, rather than scientific non-support.
